<title>v7 — Implementation handoff</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,500;8..60,600;8..60,700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --paper:#f3efe7; --paper-deep:#ece7dc; --paper-edge:#d9d2c2;
    --ink:#14110d; --ink-soft:#2a2620; --muted:#6b6358; --muted-2:#8a8174;
    --rule:#1c1917; --rule-hair:#c8c2b6;
    --accent:#b07418; --accent-deep:#7c4f0f;
    --sig-green:#5a6b3e;
    --serif:"Source Serif 4",Georgia,serif;
    --sans:"IBM Plex Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;
    --mono:"IBM Plex Mono",ui-monospace,monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--serif);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility}
  body{font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;font-feature-settings:"ss01","onum"}
  .mast{border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--paper);z-index:10}
  .mast-inner{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px 56px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .mast .pub{font-weight:600}
  .mast .meta{display:flex;gap:28px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
  .mast .meta b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 56px 120px}
  .kicker{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-top:56px}
  .kicker .num{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;margin-right:8px}
  h1.display{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(40px,5.4vw,76px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:16px 0 0;max-width:18ch;text-wrap:balance}
  h1.display em{font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:var(--accent-deep)}
  .dek{margin:28px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:38em;font-weight:400}
  .byline{margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);display:flex;gap:36px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .byline b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

  .section{margin-top:96px;padding-top:28px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
  .sh{display:grid;grid-template-columns:96px 1fr;gap:32px;align-items:baseline}
  .sn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}
  .sn::before{content:"§";margin-right:6px;color:var(--accent);font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-size:16px}
  .st{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:38px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin:0;max-width:24ch;text-wrap:balance}
  .body{margin-top:36px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:96px 1fr;gap:32px}
  .gutter{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
  .prose{max-width:38em;font-size:18px;line-height:1.62;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .prose p{margin:0 0 18px}
  .prose strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
  .prose em{color:var(--ink);font-style:italic}

  /* file cards */
  .files{margin-top:36px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
  .file{display:grid;grid-template-columns:48px 1fr 280px 100px;gap:24px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-hair);align-items:baseline}
  .file .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.06em}
  .file h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:20px;margin:0 0 4px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.25}
  .file .path{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted-2);margin-bottom:8px;display:block}
  .file p{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0;max-width:46em}
  .file .who{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;line-height:1.5}
  .file .who b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;display:block;margin-bottom:2px}
  .file .who small{display:block;color:var(--muted-2);font-weight:400;margin-top:2px;letter-spacing:.04em}
  .file .link{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:2px;justify-self:end;align-self:start}
  .file .link:hover{color:var(--accent-deep);border-color:var(--accent-deep)}

  /* tracks table */
  .tracks{margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
  .track{display:grid;grid-template-columns:96px 1fr 220px 140px;gap:24px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-hair);align-items:baseline}
  .track .id{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:32px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink);line-height:1}
  .track .id small{display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}
  .track h4{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--ink)}
  .track p{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.5;max-width:46em}
  .track .scope{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.5}
  .track .scope b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px}
  .track .time{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);text-align:right;font-weight:500}
  .track .time small{display:block;font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.16em;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:4px;font-weight:500}
  .track.rec{background:var(--paper-deep);margin-left:-12px;padding-left:12px}
  .track.rec h4::after{content:" · recommended";font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase}

  /* prompt list */
  .prompts{margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
  .prompt{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr 160px;gap:24px;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-hair);align-items:baseline}
  .prompt .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:500}
  .prompt h4{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:17px;margin:0 0 3px;color:var(--ink)}
  .prompt p{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.5}
  .prompt .files{margin:6px 0 0;padding:0;border:0;display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted-2)}
  .prompt .tag{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5}
  .prompt .tag b{color:var(--ink);display:block;font-weight:600}
  .prompt.l b{color:var(--muted)}
  .prompt.m b{color:var(--accent-deep)}
  .prompt.f b{color:var(--ink)}

  /* arch diagram */
  .arch{grid-column:1 / -1;margin-top:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}
  .arch-card{border:1px solid var(--rule-hair);padding:22px;background:var(--paper)}
  .arch-card .h{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px;font-weight:600}
  .arch-card.before .h{color:#8a4646}
  .arch-card.after .h{color:var(--sig-green)}
  .arch-card pre{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ink);background:transparent;padding:0;margin:0;white-space:pre-wrap;border:0}
  .arch-card pre b{color:var(--accent-deep)}
  .arch-card pre .strike{text-decoration:line-through;color:var(--muted-2)}

  /* token preview */
  .tokens{margin-top:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}
  .tok{border:1px solid var(--rule-hair);padding:14px}
  .tok .sw{height:56px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .tok .name{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--ink)}
  .tok .val{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
  .tok .role{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted-2);margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}

  /* questions */
  .qs{counter-reset:q;margin-top:8px;list-style:none;padding:0}
  .qs li{counter-increment:q;display:grid;grid-template-columns:48px 1fr 220px;gap:18px;padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule-hair);align-items:baseline}
  .qs li:first-child{border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}
  .qs li::before{content:counter(q,decimal-leading-zero);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:.06em}
  .qs h5{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 3px}
  .qs p{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.5}
  .qs .def{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;line-height:1.5}
  .qs .def b{color:var(--ink);display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3px;font-weight:600}

  /* dl */
  .stack{margin-top:24px}
  .stack dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:160px 1fr;gap:14px 24px;margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:18px}
  .stack dt{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--ink)}
  .stack dd{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.5}

  /* foot */
  footer{margin-top:120px;padding-top:32px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px}
  footer b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

  /* pull */
  .pull{margin:32px 0;padding:22px 28px;background:var(--paper-deep);border-left:2px solid var(--accent);font-family:var(--serif);font-size:17px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink);max-width:38em}
  .pull .src{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600}

  /* command */
  code.cmd{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;background:var(--paper-deep);padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid var(--rule-hair);color:var(--ink)}

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .wrap{padding:0 24px 80px}
    .sh,.body{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}
    .file,.track,.prompt,.qs li{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}
    .file .link{justify-self:start}
    .arch{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .tokens{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    h1.display{font-size:44px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- masthead -->
<div class="mast">
  <div class="mast-inner">
    <div class="pub">Atlas&nbsp;·&nbsp;v7 design direction</div>
    <div class="meta">
      <span><b>Implementation handoff</b></span>
      <span>PM&thinsp;+&thinsp;Claude Code&thinsp;+&thinsp;Codex</span>
      <span>May 24, 2026</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

  <div class="kicker"><span class="num">v7</span> Design direction &nbsp;·&nbsp; Home page hierarchy</div>
  <h1 class="display">Implementation <em>handoff.</em></h1>
  <p class="dek">
    A drop-in pack for the home page redesign — diagnosis, decision options for
    PM, exact tokens, sequential prompts for the coding agent, copy bank, and a
    QA checklist. Slots into the repo as <code class="cmd">docs/v7-design-direction/</code>.
  </p>
  <div class="byline">
    <span><b>Scope</b>&nbsp; Home page only</span>
    <span><b>Stack</b>&nbsp; Next 16 · React 19 · Tailwind v4 · TS</span>
    <span><b>Honors</b>&nbsp; AGENTS.md, no new deps, smallest diff</span>
    <span><b>Touches</b>&nbsp; 0 data files</span>
  </div>

  <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
       § 01  THE PACK
       ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="sh">
      <div class="sn">01 &nbsp; The pack</div>
      <h2 class="st">Eight files. Two read paths.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="gutter">How to use</div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          The PM reads files <strong>00 → 01 → 02</strong> and answers ten open
          questions at the foot of <strong>01</strong>. The coder reads
          <strong>02 → 03 → 05</strong> for reference, then runs the prompts in
          <strong>04</strong> one at a time. Reviewer signs off against
          <strong>06</strong> after each prompt.
        </p>
        <p>
          Files are plain markdown. Drop the folder into the repo's
          <code class="cmd">docs/</code> directory and open them in VS Code
          panels alongside the prompts you're running.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="files">

      <div class="file">
        <div class="n">00</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Critique summary</h3>
          <span class="path">docs/v7-design-direction/00_critique_summary.md</span>
          <p>Diagnosis. Six points on hierarchy, what to remove, what not to change, seven other observations. The compact version of the standalone Design Critique.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who"><b>For</b> PM, design lead, you<small>5 min read</small></div>
        <a class="link" href="docs/v7-design-direction/00_critique_summary.md">Open →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="file">
        <div class="n">01</div>
        <div>
          <h3>PM decision brief</h3>
          <span class="path">docs/v7-design-direction/01_pm_decision_brief.md</span>
          <p>Three implementation tracks (Light / Medium / Full) with trade-offs, time, risk. Four design trade-offs to choose (serif flavor, accent, exhibit format, Core Question disposition). Ten open questions for the PM to answer before handing to the coder.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who"><b>For</b> PM AI<small>10 min read</small></div>
        <a class="link" href="docs/v7-design-direction/01_pm_decision_brief.md">Open →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="file">
        <div class="n">02</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Information architecture</h3>
          <span class="path">docs/v7-design-direction/02_information_architecture.md</span>
          <p>The new home page section list. Each row maps to a block in <code class="cmd">app/page.tsx</code>. What changes, what is preserved, where existing data lives.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who"><b>For</b> PM + coder<small>5 min read</small></div>
        <a class="link" href="docs/v7-design-direction/02_information_architecture.md">Open →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="file">
        <div class="n">03</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Design tokens spec</h3>
          <span class="path">docs/v7-design-direction/03_design_tokens_spec.md</span>
          <p>Full replacement <code class="cmd">app/globals.css</code> with the Tailwind v4 <code class="cmd">@theme inline</code> block. Font binding via <code class="cmd">next/font/google</code> in <code class="cmd">app/layout.tsx</code>. Type ramp, spacing, color usage rules.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who"><b>For</b> coder<small>10 min read</small></div>
        <a class="link" href="docs/v7-design-direction/03_design_tokens_spec.md">Open →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="file">
        <div class="n">04</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Coding agent prompts</h3>
          <span class="path">docs/v7-design-direction/04_coding_agent_prompts.md</span>
          <p>Seven sequential prompts in the v6-pack style. Pre-flight prompt + six implementation prompts. Each is self-contained, smallest coherent diff, with after-changes reporting. Run one at a time in Claude Code or Codex.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who"><b>For</b> Claude Code + Codex<small>per-prompt</small></div>
        <a class="link" href="docs/v7-design-direction/04_coding_agent_prompts.md">Open →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="file">
        <div class="n">05</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Copy bank</h3>
          <span class="path">docs/v7-design-direction/05_copy_bank.md</span>
          <p>Every string the home page renders, source-traced. No new claims. The coder pastes from this; the PM audits by diff.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who"><b>For</b> coder + PM<small>reference</small></div>
        <a class="link" href="docs/v7-design-direction/05_copy_bank.md">Open →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="file">
        <div class="n">06</div>
        <div>
          <h3>QA checklist</h3>
          <span class="path">docs/v7-design-direction/06_qa_checklist.md</span>
          <p>Acceptance criteria for each prompt. Universal, per-prompt, visual regression, accessibility, data-integrity, sub-page no-regression. Definition of done.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who"><b>For</b> reviewer<small>reference</small></div>
        <a class="link" href="docs/v7-design-direction/06_qa_checklist.md">Open →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="file">
        <div class="n">+</div>
        <div>
          <h3>README — index &amp; orientation</h3>
          <span class="path">docs/v7-design-direction/README.md</span>
          <p>Pack entry point. Audience-by-file map, sequence, what changes at a glance, constraints honored.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="who"><b>For</b> first reader<small>3 min read</small></div>
        <a class="link" href="docs/v7-design-direction/README.md">Open →</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px;line-height:1.6;">
      Also still available: <a href="Design Critique.html" style="color:var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule-hair);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Design Critique.html</a> — the original long-form critique &amp; mockup of redesigned first two scrolls. The pack above is the engineering-actionable distillation of that critique.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
       § 02  THE THREE TRACKS
       ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="sh">
      <div class="sn">02 &nbsp; Tracks</div>
      <h2 class="st">PM picks one. Tracks are additive.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <div class="gutter">Logic</div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          The critique identifies six hierarchy problems. They cluster into
          three families of change (visual register, hero recomposition,
          argument consolidation). Each ships independently. Picking a track
          tells the coder how many prompts to run.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tracks">

      <div class="track">
        <div class="id">L<small>Light</small></div>
        <div>
          <h4>Typography + tokens only</h4>
          <p>
            Move the site from default sans on white cards to editorial serif
            on warm paper. Touches two files. Reflows every page. No layout
            change. Lowest possible risk.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="scope">
          <b>Touches</b>
          app/layout.tsx<br/>
          app/globals.css<br/>
          <b style="margin-top:6px;">Prompts</b>
          01
        </div>
        <div class="time">~1 day<small>0 deps added</small></div>
      </div>

      <div class="track rec">
        <div class="id">M<small>Medium</small></div>
        <div>
          <h4>L + hero recomposition + masthead</h4>
          <p>
            Single primary CTA. Beta caveat shrunk to footnote. Anchor-firms
            exhibit replaces Core Question aside. Top masthead added. Addresses
            four of six hierarchy problems while leaving the body alone.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="scope">
          <b>Touches</b>
          + app/page.tsx (hero only)<br/>
          + anchor-firms-exhibit.tsx<br/>
          + atlas-masthead.tsx<br/>
          <b style="margin-top:6px;">Prompts</b>
          01 · 02 · 03
        </div>
        <div class="time">~2 days<small>0 deps added</small></div>
      </div>

      <div class="track">
        <div class="id">F<small>Full</small></div>
        <div>
          <h4>M + argument consolidation</h4>
          <p>
            Merge the four-card Analyst Brief, the standalone stat strip and
            the three-card Findings into one argument section with a drop-cap
            lede, three prose findings, and the source-base band. Eyebrow
            inflation stripped from exhibits. Strongest result.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="scope">
          <b>Touches</b>
          + the-argument.tsx<br/>
          + edits to four exhibit headers<br/>
          + geography standfirst<br/>
          + source-trail tokens<br/>
          <b style="margin-top:6px;">Prompts</b>
          01 · 02 · 03 · 04 · 05 · 06 · 07
        </div>
        <div class="time">~3–4 days<small>0 deps added</small></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
       § 03  WHAT CHANGES
       ────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="sh">
      <div class="sn">03 &nbsp; Diff</div>
      <h2 class="st">What the home looks like, before and after.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <div class="gutter">Sections</div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          The proposal preserves the city map, the lab-to-fab chain, and the
          source-trail dark section — all already in the right editorial
          register. The collapse is in the top half, where three blocks
          currently restate the same three findings.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="arch">
      <div class="arch-card before">
        <div class="h">v6 today</div>
<pre><span class="strike">[ HERO ]
  3 equal CTAs
  Core question aside
  Beta caveat (headline weight)</span>

[ 01 Analyst brief ] <span class="strike">— 4 cards</span>
[ Stat strip ]       <span class="strike">— 4 counts, buried</span>
[ 02 Findings ]      <span class="strike">— 3 cards</span>

[ 03 Exhibits ]
  FirmWorkforceChart
  DisciplineSegmentMatrix
  ToolmakerFootprintGrid
  ComparatorFrame

[ 04 Geography ]   CitySignalMap
