      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          After every prompt: <code class="cmd">npm run lint &amp;&amp; npm run build</code>.
          Commit only on green. The prompts read the repo before changing
          anything; both Claude Code and Codex understand them identically.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prompts">
      <div class="prompt l">
        <div class="n">00</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Pre-flight — read the repo</h4>
          <p>Read AGENTS.md, the v7 pack, the home page + layout + globals + key data files. Report state. Change nothing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tag"><b>any track</b>~10 min</div>
      </div>

      <div class="prompt l">
        <div class="n">01</div>
        <div>
          <h4>Design tokens + fonts</h4>
